# Admin Components - Simplified

## Consolidated Components

This project uses **3 core admin components** instead of 53 separate files.

## Core Components

### 1. ConsolidatedAdminForm
```javascript
// ✅ Single form component for all admin forms
import ConsolidatedAdminForm, { FormField } from './ConsolidatedAdminForm.jsx';

function ParticipantForm({ participant, onSubmit }) {
  return (
    <ConsolidatedAdminForm
      title="Edit Participant"
      onSubmit={onSubmit}
      loading={isLoading}
    >
      <FormField
        name="name"
        label="Name"
        required
        control={control}
      />
      <FormField
        name="region"
        label="Region"
        control={control}
      />
    </ConsolidatedAdminForm>
  );
}
```

### 2. ConsolidatedAdminTable
```javascript
// ✅ Single table component for all admin tables
import ConsolidatedAdminTable from './ConsolidatedAdminTable.jsx';

function ParticipantsList({ participants, onEdit, onDelete }) {
  const columns = [
    { key: 'name', label: 'Name' },
    { key: 'region', label: 'Region' },
    { key: 'actions', label: 'Actions' }
  ];

  return (
    <ConsolidatedAdminTable
      columns={columns}
      data={participants}
      onRowClick={onEdit}
      actions={onDelete}
    />
  );
}
```

### 3. SimplifiedRoundsAdmin
```javascript
// ✅ Single component for rounds management
import { RoundForm, RoundsList } from './SimplifiedRoundsAdmin.jsx';

function RoundsAdmin() {
  return (
    <div>
      <RoundForm onSubmit={handleSubmit} />
      <RoundsList rounds={rounds} onEdit={handleEdit} />
    </div>
  );
}
```

