## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

### ❌ Multiple Form Components
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T create separate form components
<ParticipantForm />
<RoundForm />
<NewsForm />
<CityTipForm />
```

### ❌ Complex Table Components
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T create complex table abstractions
<AdvancedDataTable
  columns={complexColumns}
  filters={complexFilters}
  sorting={complexSorting}
  pagination={complexPagination}
/>
```

### ❌ Separate Management Components
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T create separate management components
<CrewManagement />
<FeatureArtistManagement />
<ModeratorManagement />
```

## Benefits

- **3 components** - Instead of 53 separate files
- **Reusable** - Same components for all entities
- **Consistent** - Uniform UI across admin
- **Maintainable** - Easy to update and modify
- **Simple** - Easy to understand and debug

## File Organization

```
client/components/admin/
  ConsolidatedAdminForm.jsx      # All forms
  ConsolidatedAdminTable.jsx     # All tables
  SimplifiedRoundsAdmin.jsx      # Rounds management
  AdminDashboard.jsx             # Main dashboard
  AdminLayout.jsx                # Layout wrapper
```

## Usage Patterns

### CRUD Operations
```javascript
// ✅ Standard CRUD pattern
function AdminEntity({ entity, onSave, onDelete }) {
  const [isEditing, setIsEditing] = useState(false);
  
  return (
    <div>
      {isEditing ? (
        <ConsolidatedAdminForm
          data={entity}
          onSubmit={onSave}
          onCancel={() => setIsEditing(false)}
        />
      ) : (
        <ConsolidatedAdminTable
          data={[entity]}
          onEdit={() => setIsEditing(true)}
          onDelete={onDelete}
        />
      )}
    </div>
  );
}
```

### Data Management
```javascript
// ✅ Simple data flow
const { data, isLoading } = useQuery(['participants'], fetchParticipants);
const createMutation = useMutation(createParticipant);
const updateMutation = useMutation(updateParticipant);
const deleteMutation = useMutation(deleteParticipant);
```